sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant UI as User Interface
    participant Claim as Claim Module
    participant DB as SQLite
    participant Admin
    Student->>UI: Select item and submit claim
    UI->>Claim: add_claim(item, student, note)
    Claim->>DB: Insert claim
    DB-->>Claim: Saved
    Claim-->>UI: Success message
    Admin->>UI: Open admin claims
    UI->>Claim: get_claims(admin)
    Claim->>DB: Read claims
    DB-->>Claim: Claim list
    Claim-->>UI: Claim list
    Admin->>UI: Approve claim
    UI->>Claim: set_claim(id, approved)
    Claim->>DB: Update claim and item
    DB-->>Claim: Updated
